        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu, sisya, mĩthenya nĩyũkĩte, easya Yeova, ĩla kũikaneenwa ĩngĩ, O tondũ Yeova wĩ thayũ, ũla waumisye ana ma Isilaeli Misili; ",
